1
00:00:01,434 --> 00:00:04,062
（當你懷孕時，你該期待什麼）

2
00:00:08,470 --> 00:00:11,060
Did you know that during pregnancy..
你知道懷孕的時候…

3
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:16,570
your fingers swell up to twice their size and never go back?
你的手指會腫成兩倍大 而且再也不會消了嗎？

4
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:19,380
Oh, my God! Let me see that.
天啊，讓我看看

5
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:23,680
You fall for it every time.
你每次都會上當

6
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:27,550
Hey! I brought you my old maternity clothes.
我把我的舊孕婦裝 拿來給你

7
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:32,720
Oh, Pheebs, that's so sweet. Oh, those are so cute!
菲比，那真的是太棒了 好可愛喔！

8
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:37,160
Look. See how they expand as the baby grows?
你看，寶寶越長越大 它們也會跟著撐開來

9
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:42,670
And after the baby's born they're great for shoplifting melons.
寶寶出生後 可以穿它去偷西瓜

10
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:48,040
Good, you're all here. Thanksgiving, 4:00.
太好了，你們都在 感恩節，明天四點

11
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:52,680
Guess who I invited? Remember Will Culvert from high school?
你猜我邀請了誰？ 還記得高中同學威爾卡佛特嗎？

12
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:55,540
-No. -He was in Ross' class.
-不 -他跟羅斯同班

13
00:00:55,750 --> 00:01:00,410
Marching band, was kind of overweight. Really overweight.
他是儀仗隊的，有點胖 他是個大胖子

14
00:01:00,690 --> 00:01:02,250
I was his thin friend.
我屬於他瘦朋友那一群

15
00:01:04,490 --> 00:01:08,900
I don't remember. Are you talking about your imaginary boyfriend?
我不記得 你是說你假想的男朋友嗎？

16
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:12,070
No, that was Jared.
不，那是賈拉德

17
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:17,070
Wow. Haven't thought about him in a long time.
我好久 沒有想起他了

18
00:01:19,310 --> 00:01:23,770
Will's here on business, and he didn't have a place to go, so I invited him here.
威爾來城裡出差，他沒地方可去 所以我邀請他過來

19
00:01:24,010 --> 00:01:28,380
-That's nice. -Oh, he's lost a bunch of weight.
-那很好啊 -他減肥成功

20
00:01:28,580 --> 00:01:32,080
He looks good. Okay, I mean really gorgeous.
他看起來很不錯 好吧，他真的是帥呆了

21
00:01:36,620 --> 00:01:41,250
-I still love Chandler. -Wouldn't hurt you to say it once in a while.
-我還愛著錢德 -偶爾說一下不會要你命的

22
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:46,230
Just so you know, I'm not gonna make a turkey this year..
先說好了 今年我不煮火雞…

23
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,130
-What? -Phoebe doesn't eat turkey.
-什麼？ -菲比不吃火雞

24
00:01:49,340 --> 00:01:53,770
-Phoebe! -Turkeys are beautiful, intelligent animals.
-菲比 -火雞是漂亮聰明的動物

25
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:59,070
No, they're not! They're ugly and stupid and delicious!
不是的 他們既丑又笨，也很好吃

26
00:01:59,250 --> 00:02:01,220
Plus, eating them is like a tradition.
而且吃火雞是傳統

27
00:02:01,380 --> 00:02:06,150
It goes back to the first Thanksgiving when the lndians sat down with the cowboys.
這得回溯至第一次過感恩節時 印第安人跟牛仔坐在一起

28
00:02:06,860 --> 00:02:12,090
Oh, right. That's when they had that big rodeo at Plymouth Rock.
對，那個時候 他們在普利茅斯石辦牛仔表演

29
00:02:12,490 --> 00:02:16,730
It's not just Phoebe. Will's still on a diet, Chandler doesn't eat Thanksgiving food..
不只是菲比，威爾還在節食 錢德不吃感恩節食物…

30
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:20,300
-Rachel's having her aversion to poultry. -She is?
-瑞秋對家禽類反胃 -是嗎？

31
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:23,900
Yeah. Remember? I had to leave the other day when you had that chicken.
對，記得嗎？ 那天你吃雞肉時我得走開

32
00:02:24,110 --> 00:02:26,370
I thought that was because I put the whole thing..
我以為那是因為 我手裡…

33
00:02:26,540 --> 00:02:28,740
on my hand and made it walk across the table.
拿著雞要他在桌上走的關係

34
00:02:29,940 --> 00:02:34,880
It's not worth it to make a whole turkey for just three people. It's a lot of work.
為了三個人做一隻火雞太不划算了 那真的很費功夫

35
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:37,580
But you gotta have turkey on Thanksgiving!
但感恩節一定要吃火雞啊

36
00:02:37,820 --> 00:02:42,550
Thanksgiving with no turkey is like Fourth of July with no apple pie.
感恩節不吃火雞 就像國慶日不吃蘋果派

37
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:45,950
Or Friday with no two pizzas.
或是星期五不吃兩個披薩

38
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:50,590
Fine, if it means that much to you. But there's gonna be a ton left over.
好吧，如果它真的對你很重要 但到時候一定會剩下很多

39
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:53,320
No. I promise I will finish that turkey.
不，我發誓我會把那只火雞吃完

40
00:02:53,570 --> 00:02:57,470
You're telling me you can eat almost an entire turkey in one sitting?
你是說你可以一次 吃掉一整只火雞？

41
00:02:57,710 --> 00:03:03,640
That's right. Because I'm a Tribbiani! This is what we do.
沒錯，因為我是崔比亞尼家的人 這是我們的專長

42
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:07,850
We may not be great thinkers or world leaders..
我們不是偉大的思想家 或世界領袖…

43
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:12,820
we don't read a lot or run fast, but damn it, we can eat!
我們書念的不多，跑不快 但該死，我們是大胃王

44
00:03:13,793 --> 00:03:15,852
The One With The Rumour
本集播出：謠言

45
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:51,530
Four wide receivers. On third and 18.
第四次長傳，第三次18碼

46
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:57,360
Isn't it weird how next year there will be a baby at the table?
明年桌邊會坐一個寶寶 感覺真的很奇怪吧？

47
00:04:00,370 --> 00:04:04,130
Rachel's. But good to know where you're at.
我是指瑞秋的孩子 但我很高興你還有在聽我說話

48
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,140
-Hey! -Hey!
-嘿 -嘿

49
00:04:06,370 --> 00:04:08,270
-Happy Thanksgiving. -You too!
-感恩節快樂 -你也是

50
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:10,410
-Can I help? -Yes.
-需要我幫忙嗎？ -好啊

51
00:04:10,650 --> 00:04:13,710
Chandler usually helps, but he's into the game.
通常錢德會幫忙 但他看球賽看得正入迷

52
00:04:13,950 --> 00:04:18,910
Could you fold these napkins? I'm gonna go across the hall to check on the yams.
麻煩你幫忙折餐巾 我要去對面看看地瓜泥好了沒

53
00:04:19,190 --> 00:04:22,920
No, sweetie. No, not like that.
不，甜心，不是那樣的

54
00:04:23,190 --> 00:04:26,250
We're not at a barn dance.
我們不是在辦農場舞會

55
00:04:26,530 --> 00:04:30,160
Fold them like swans. I showed you at Christmas. Remember?
把它們折成天鵝的形狀 我在耶誕節時教過你，記得嗎？

56
00:04:30,330 --> 00:04:33,890
Yeah, it all just came screaming back to me.
記得，一切歷歷如新

57
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:39,940
-So how's the game? -I have no idea.
-球賽還好看嗎？ -我不知道

58
00:04:40,210 --> 00:04:42,440
-What? -I'm pretending to watch..
-什麼？ -我假裝看球賽…

59
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:44,840
so I don't have to help out.
那樣子就不必幫忙

60
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:51,840
I don't believe you! That is brilliant!
我不敢相信 這招太高明了

62
00:04:52,350 --> 00:04:54,250
-And Monica has no idea? -No.
-摩妮卡不知道？ -對

63
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:57,650
Once in a while, I just yell stuff at the TV.
偶爾 我會對著電視大叫

64
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:01,650
Hey! What? Aw! Hey!
嘿，什麼？啊

65
00:05:03,060 --> 00:05:06,930
-Your team winning? -Anderson just scored again.
-你的球隊贏了嗎？ -安德森剛剛又得分了

66
00:05:07,170 --> 00:05:09,970
There is no Anderson.
根本就沒有安德森這號人物

67
00:05:11,410 --> 00:05:14,380
I wanna get in on this. Hey, Mon?
我也想如法炮製，摩妮卡

68
00:05:14,580 --> 00:05:18,940
I can't help you after all. I didn't realize this game was on.
我真的沒辦法幫你 我不知道球賽打到哪裡了

69
00:05:19,180 --> 00:05:22,080
-You like football? -Normally, I don't.
-你喜歡美式足球？ -通常我是不喜歡

70
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:26,190
But, you know, Green Bay is playing.
但今天是綠灣隊在比賽

71
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:31,060
-You like Green Bay? -It's only my favorite bay.
-你喜歡綠灣隊？ -那是我最喜歡的海灣

72
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:46,730
-Happy Thanksgiving. -Will, I'm so glad that you came.
-感恩節快樂 -威爾，我很高興你能來

73
00:05:46,970 --> 00:05:48,810
You look great. You must've lost..
你看起來帥呆了，你一定減掉了…

74
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:53,710
150 pounds. I'll be on one of those Subway commercials.
150磅 我會是潛水艇三明治廣告的下一號人選

75
00:05:55,720 --> 00:06:00,090
-A pie! -It's no fat, no sugar, no dairy.
-是派 -零脂肪，無糖，也沒有奶

76
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:03,850
-It's no good. Throw it out. -Meet some people.
-它不好吃，丟了它 -我來介紹你們認識

77
00:06:04,090 --> 00:06:07,060
This is my husband, Chandler. This is Will.
他是我丈夫錢德 他是威爾

78
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:12,100
Oh, hey. I'd shake your hand but I'm really into the game.
我很想跟你握手 但我忙著看球賽

79
00:06:12,330 --> 00:06:17,000
Plus, it'd be better for my ego if we didn't stand next to each other.
而且我們兩個只要不站在一起 就不會傷了我的自尊

80
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,600
-This is Phoebe. -Hi.
-她是菲比 -嗨

81
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:24,900
Hey. Wow!
嘿，哇

82
00:06:27,380 --> 00:06:29,440
Well done.
做的好

83
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:34,850
-Wanna give me a hand? -I can't get over how great you look.
-你要幫我嗎？ -我真的覺得你很漂亮

84
00:06:35,060 --> 00:06:40,760
-You look incredible too. You're so fit. -I'm watching the game, but I'm not deaf.
-你也很帥，你的身材真棒 -我在看球賽，但我沒聾

85
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:46,020
-I meant to tell you, Ross is coming. -Great, I love Ross.
-我一直想告訴你，羅斯也會來 -太棒了，我喜歡羅斯

86
00:06:46,230 --> 00:06:49,100
Good. And Rachel Greene too.
很好，瑞秋葛林也會來

87
00:06:52,340 --> 00:06:55,900
-Is there a problem? -No. It's okay.
-有問題嗎？ -沒有，沒關係的

88
00:06:56,140 --> 00:07:00,080
It's just.. God, I hated her.
那只是…天啊，我恨她

89
00:07:00,750 --> 00:07:02,270
-What? -I hated her.
-什麼？ -我恨她

90
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:05,710
She was horrible to me in high school.
高中時她對我很凶

91
00:07:05,950 --> 00:07:11,860
But hey, that was a long time ago. I'm in a good place. Might be fun to see her again.
但那是很久以前的事了，現在我很好 或許再見到她會很有趣

92
00:07:12,090 --> 00:07:15,590
Got any cakes or cookies or something?
你有蛋糕或餅乾嗎？

93
00:07:17,060 --> 00:07:20,000
No, Will! No!
不，威爾

94
00:07:20,230 --> 00:07:22,790
It's been a while since we screamed. Maybe we should.
我們很久沒大叫了 或許我們該大叫一下

95
00:07:23,070 --> 00:07:26,060
-Oh, okay. No! -Come on!
-好吧，不！ -加油

96
00:07:26,310 --> 00:07:30,180
Damn you, ref! You burn in hell!
該死的裁判，下地獄去吧！

97
00:07:33,780 --> 00:07:38,150
What are you doing? You've got an entire turkey to eat.
你在做什麼？ 你還得吃掉一整只火雞

98
00:07:38,390 --> 00:07:41,980
Let me explain to you how the human body works.
讓我跟你解釋一下 人體的運作方式

99
00:07:42,190 --> 00:07:44,990
I have to warm up my stomach first.
我得先讓我的胃暖暖身

100
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:48,890
-Eating chips is like stretching. -Okay.
-吃薯片像是在做拉筋運動 -好吧

101
00:07:49,100 --> 00:07:53,970
-Don't worry, Tribbianis never get full. -I'm here to tell you something.
-別擔心，崔比亞尼永遠吃不飽 -我要告訴你一件事

102
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:58,540
You can eat and eat, but nothing will ever fill that void.
你可以吃個不停 但你無法填滿內心的空虛

103
00:08:00,310 --> 00:08:05,540
-Who the hell is this guy? -This is Will, from high school. This is Joey.
-這傢伙到底是誰？ -他是我們的高中同學威爾，他是喬伊

104
00:08:05,710 --> 00:08:07,700
-Want some chips? -No.
-要來點薯片嗎？ -不

105
00:08:09,980 --> 00:08:11,280
-Will! -Ross!
-威爾 -羅斯

106
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:17,420
Hey, you came! Man, you look incredible! Hot stuff!
你來了 天啊，你看起來棒極了，大帥哥

107
00:08:18,530 --> 00:08:21,830
-Hot stuff? -It's good to see you, man.
-大帥哥？ -很高興能見到你

108
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:24,830
Yeah. You too. So, what are you up to?
我也是，你是做哪一行的？

109
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:29,340
-I'm a commodities broker. -That sounds interesting.
-我是期貨經紀人 -聽起來很有趣

110
00:08:29,540 --> 00:08:32,130
-Yeah, it's not. -Oh.
-才怪 -喔

111
00:08:32,370 --> 00:08:35,470
-But I'm rich and thin. -Oh.
-但我現在既有錢又苗條 -喔

112
00:08:35,680 --> 00:08:40,380
I haven't seen you since Lance Davis' graduation party.
自從蘭西戴維斯的畢業派對之後 我就沒有見過你

113
00:08:40,620 --> 00:08:42,380
That was such a fun night.
那一晚真的很瘋狂

114
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:46,820
Would've been good if we had gotten in, but still fun.
如果我們都有被邀請就好了 但那還是很瘋狂

115
00:08:47,020 --> 00:08:51,690
We were lame. Do you remember how into dinosaurs we were?
那時我們遜呆了 你還記得我們多迷恐龍嗎？

116
00:08:54,430 --> 00:08:57,360
-Yeah. -So, what do you do now?
-對 -你是做哪一行的？

117
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:01,760
So how long are you in town?
你要在城裡待多久？

118
00:09:02,940 --> 00:09:06,500
-Hi. -Hey, sweetie. Oh, good.
-嗨 -嘿，甜心，太好了

119
00:09:06,710 --> 00:09:08,200
Rachel Greene.
瑞秋葛林

120
00:09:09,940 --> 00:09:12,670
Oh, that's right. Are you gonna be okay?
啊，對了 你沒事吧？

121
00:09:12,910 --> 00:09:19,010
Oh, I'll be fine. It's just.. God, I hate her, Ross! I hate her!
我沒事，只是… 天啊，羅斯，我恨她

122
00:09:21,060 --> 00:09:23,350
High school was a long time ago.
高中是很久以前的事了

123
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:26,650
Look at her standing there with those yams.
看看她拿著地瓜泥 站在那裡的樣子

124
00:09:26,860 --> 00:09:32,460
My two greatest enemies: Rachel Greene and complex carbohydrates.
我的兩個死對頭 瑞秋葛林跟碳水化合物

125
00:09:33,870 --> 00:09:35,730
Oh, my God. Who is that?
天啊，那是誰？

126
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:42,270
-That's Will, from high school. -Oh! I do not remember him.
-他是我們的高中同學威爾 -我不記得他了

127
00:09:42,540 --> 00:09:47,980
Wow, really got that sexy smoldering thing going on.
他真的 越來越性感了

128
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:55,950
Oh, my God. Look at the way he's just staring at me.
天啊 看他盯著我瞧的樣子

129
00:09:56,220 --> 00:09:58,820
He's trying to mouth something to me.
他用唇語跟我說話

130
00:09:59,090 --> 00:10:02,720
I hate you!
我恨你

131
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:06,190
-Okay, dinner's ready! -Okay!
-好了，晚餐準備好了 -好吧

132
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:10,270
-Solid effort. Solid effort. -Oh, so who won?
-真的很精彩 -誰贏了？

133
00:10:10,470 --> 00:10:12,800
-Green Bay. -Detroit.
-綠灣隊 -底特律隊

134
00:10:13,010 --> 00:10:15,570
-What? -The Lions technically won.
-什麼？ -技術上來說獅隊贏了

135
00:10:15,810 --> 00:10:20,750
But it was a moral victory for the Green Bay Mermen.
但在士氣方面 是綠灣美人魚隊贏了

136
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:27,920
Hi! Will, right? Right, hi. I'm Rachel Greene.
嗨，你是威爾吧？ 嗨，我是瑞秋葛林

137
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:33,220
-Oh, I remember you. -Really? Aren't you sweet?
-我記得你 -真的嗎？你真好

138
00:10:33,430 --> 00:10:38,590
I gotta tell you, I'm having the hardest time placing you.
我得告訴你 我真的很難記得你的樣子

139
00:10:38,830 --> 00:10:41,230
Hang on! I think I remember you.
等一下，我想我記得你

140
00:10:41,470 --> 00:10:46,930
Did we fool around at Lance Davis' graduation party?
我們在蘭西戴維斯的畢業派對上 廝混過？

141
00:10:47,610 --> 00:10:50,870
-You are unbelievable. -Thank you.
-你真是不可思議 -謝謝你

142
00:10:51,810 --> 00:10:57,010
Rachel? Why don't you sit here? And Will, you sit way over there.
瑞秋，你坐這邊 威爾，你坐到那邊去

143
00:11:02,890 --> 00:11:06,380
That's it? Even if nobody helps me, I can eat that. No problem.
就那樣？即使沒有人幫我 我也可以吃掉它，沒問題

144
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:11,890
-At least give me a challenge. -This is Chandler's chicken.
-至少給我一點挑戰 -這是錢德的雞肉

145
00:11:13,500 --> 00:11:16,630
This is the turkey.
這才是火雞

146
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:20,770
Oh. How big is that?
那有多大呢？

147
00:11:20,980 --> 00:11:26,410
-About 19 pounds. -It's like me when I was born.
-大約19磅 -它跟我剛出生時差不多大

148
00:11:27,310 --> 00:11:32,580
-Who would like some yams? Will? -You'd like that, wouldn't you?
-誰想吃地瓜泥？威爾？ -你喜歡那樣做，對吧？

149
00:11:34,220 --> 00:11:37,160
What? Oh, can we please keep the chicken..
什麼？ 拜託把雞肉…

150
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:39,880
and the turkey on the other side?
跟火雞放到另一邊去

151
00:11:40,090 --> 00:11:43,860
-The smell is just.. -Typical.
-那個味道真的… -太典型了

152
00:11:45,700 --> 00:11:48,030
-What? -I said it was typical.
-什麼？ -我說那太典型了

153
00:11:48,300 --> 00:11:54,400
Typical of you. Queen Rachel does whatever she wants in Rachel-land.
你的典型作風，瑞秋女王 在瑞秋王國想做什麼就做什麼

154
00:11:58,850 --> 00:12:00,680
Seriously, who is this guy?
說真的，這傢伙是誰？

155
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:04,850
Sorry, do you have a problem with me?
抱歉，你對我有問題嗎？

156
00:12:05,050 --> 00:12:10,080
-I don't know. Do I? Do I? -I think you do.
-我不知道，我有嗎？ -我想你有

157
00:12:11,730 --> 00:12:14,460
You were a little mean to him in high school.
你在高中時對他有點凶

158
00:12:14,700 --> 00:12:19,360
-A little mean? You made my life miserable. -I had no idea. I'm sorry.
-有點凶？你讓我活在痛苦深淵 -我不知道，抱歉

159
00:12:19,570 --> 00:12:23,260
Well, you should be. Screw it. Bring on the yams.
你應該抱歉的 去他的，把地瓜泥拿過來給我

160
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:25,260
But you worked so hard.
但你很努力在減肥

161
00:12:25,470 --> 00:12:27,940
-Yams! -Okay.
-地瓜泥 -好的

162
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:35,240
I'm real sorry for whatever I did to you in high school.
不論在高中時我對你做了什麼 我都非常抱歉

163
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:38,380
It wasn't just me. We had a club.
不只是我，我們組了一個社團

164
00:12:38,620 --> 00:12:43,490
-You had a club? -The "I Hate Rachel Greene Club"!
-你們組了一個社團？ -「我恨瑞秋葛林社」

165
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:47,390
So you all just joined together to hate me?
你們全都聚在一起恨我？

166
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:51,900
-Who else was in this club? -Me and Ross.
-還有誰加入那個社團？ -我跟羅斯

167
00:12:56,400 --> 00:13:00,270
No need to point. She knows who Ross is.
你不必指我 她知道羅斯是誰

168
00:13:06,580 --> 00:13:10,880
-You were in an "I Hate Rachel" club? -Yes, he was.
-你參加「我恨瑞秋社」？ -沒錯

169
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:12,350
No, no.
不

170
00:13:14,050 --> 00:13:19,920
-So who else was in this club? -That exchange student from Thailand.
-還有誰參加了你們的社團？ -那個來自泰國的交換學生

171
00:13:20,130 --> 00:13:24,290
But I don't think he knew what it was.
但我想他不知道那是怎麼一回事

172
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:26,860
You guys were cool.
你們太酷了

173
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:29,460
So, Ross, we went out for two years..
羅斯，我們交往了兩年…

174
00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:32,470
and you never told me you were in an "I Hate Rachel Club"?
你沒有告訴我 你參加過「我恨瑞秋社」？

175
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:36,100
You went out with her? We had a pact.
你跟她交往過？我們說好的

176
00:13:37,210 --> 00:13:43,450
-It's not like it was binding forever. -It had the word "eternity" in it.
-那不是永久的約定 -我們的確說了「永遠」

177
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:47,740
I'm thinking of joining an "I Hate Turkey Club."
我考慮要加入「我恨火雞社」

178
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:50,550
Although, I do love a turkey club.
雖然我喜歡吃火雞三明治

179
00:13:52,460 --> 00:13:55,330
Monica? Did you know about this?
摩妮卡，你知道這件事嗎？

180
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:59,690
I didn't. Is that why you used to lock the bedroom door?
我不知道 所以你們才會常把房門鎖上嗎？

181
00:13:59,930 --> 00:14:03,430
-Yeah. -A little relieved, I gotta say.
-對 -我得說我鬆了一口氣

182
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:09,940
Look, Rach, I'm sorry, okay? I was a stupid kid, okay?
聽著，瑞秋，我很抱歉，好嗎？ 那時我是個愚蠢的孩子

183
00:14:10,210 --> 00:14:12,580
-The only reason I joined.. -Cofounded.
-我會加入社團是因為… -是一起成立

184
00:14:12,750 --> 00:14:14,610
Cofounded.
一起成立

185
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:19,640
Cofounded the club, was that I was in love with you.
我會一起成立那個社團 因為我那時瘋狂地愛著你

186
00:14:19,990 --> 00:14:23,890
I didn't handle it very well. If you think about it, the "I Hate Rachel Club"..
我處理的不好 如果你把「我恨瑞秋社」…

187
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:27,090
was really the "I Love Rachel Club."
想成「我愛瑞秋社」

188
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:30,490
Except that it was really the "I Hate Rachel Club."
但它真的是 「我恨瑞秋社」

189
00:14:30,730 --> 00:14:35,030
So you'd get together and say mean things about me?
你們一起說我的壞話？

190
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:39,600
-We did a little more than that. -No, no, no.
-不只是那樣 -不

191
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:41,510
What else did you do?
你們還做了什麼？

192
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:45,870
-We started a rumor. -What rumor?
-我們散佈一個謠言 -什麼謠言？

193
00:14:46,180 --> 00:14:50,120
Come on, Will, just take off your shirt and tell us.
快點，威爾 掙脫束縛告訴我們

194
00:14:53,490 --> 00:14:56,080
-Ross? -It was no big deal.
-羅斯 -那真的沒什麼

195
00:14:56,360 --> 00:15:02,130
We said that.. The rumor was that..
我們說…那個謠言是…

196
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:07,730
you had both male and female reproductive parts.
你同時有 男性跟女性的生殖器官

197
00:15:08,700 --> 00:15:10,900
-What? -That's right. We said your parents..
-什麼？ -沒錯，我們說你爸媽…

198
00:15:11,070 --> 00:15:17,600
flipped a coin, decided to raise you as a girl, but you still had a hint of a penis.
丟銅板決定把你當成女孩養大 但你還是有小雞雞

199
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:20,640
-Oh, my God! -You started that?
-天啊 -那是你們編的？

200
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:25,380
-You heard that? -Everyone at our school heard it!
-你也聽過？ -我們學校裡每個人都聽過

201
00:15:25,590 --> 00:15:28,890
Everyone at my school heard it. You were the hermaphrodite cheerleader?
我的學校裡每個人都聽過 你就是那個雙性啦啦隊員？

202
00:15:29,090 --> 00:15:31,060
Oh, no!
不

203
00:15:32,330 --> 00:15:36,660
It makes sense now. This is why Adam Carter wouldn't go out with me.
現在我終於懂了 所以亞當卡特不想跟我約會

204
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:39,890
Why Billy would just stay in this region.
為什麼比利 只想停留在這一區

205
00:15:40,130 --> 00:15:44,260
Billy's gay now, so that one's not really our fault.
比利成了男同志 所以那不是我們的錯

206
00:15:45,270 --> 00:15:49,070
-Why didn't you tell me? -I thought it might be true.
-你為什麼不告訴我？ -我想或許那是真的

207
00:15:49,310 --> 00:15:53,640
I was afraid that you were gonna cry and then show it to me.
我擔心你會大哭 把它掏出來給我看

208
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:02,780
Stop staring! There's nothing there! It's not true!
別看了，那裡面沒有東西 那不是真的

209
00:16:02,990 --> 00:16:05,420
I'm afraid I'm gonna need proof.
恐怕我需要證據

210
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:08,260
Come on, whip it out.
快掏出來吧

211
00:16:25,180 --> 00:16:28,210
You are my Everest.
你是我的聖母峰

212
00:16:28,420 --> 00:16:32,780
-You don't have to finish. -I do. Otherwise, what's next?
-你不必吃完它 -我要，不然接下來是什麼？

213
00:16:33,050 --> 00:16:38,250
Today I can't finish a turkey, but tomorrow I eat half a PowerBar..
今天我吃不完一隻火雞 明天我只能吃一半的三明治…

214
00:16:38,490 --> 00:16:41,760
wrap it up and put it in the fridge? No!
把剩下的東西包起來 放在冰箱？不

215
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:47,200
I gotta change my pants. What was I thinking? Jeans have no give.
我得去換條褲子，我在想什麼？ 牛仔褲根本沒有伸縮性

216
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:51,270
Guys, help me with the dishes. There's a lot of pots and pans.
大家來幫我洗碗 要洗的鍋子真的很多

217
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:54,100
Honey, I'd love to, but the second game is about to start.
甜心，我很想 但第二場比賽快開始了

218
00:16:54,270 --> 00:16:58,970
Oh, yeah, the second game. More football for the Pheebster.
對，第二場比賽 菲比隊要看足球賽

219
00:16:59,150 --> 00:17:01,380
-Who's playing? -Los Angeles.
-哪一隊要比賽？ -洛杉磯隊

220
00:17:01,550 --> 00:17:04,420
Last time I checked, Los Angeles didn't have a football team.
據我所知 洛杉磯沒有美式足球隊

221
00:17:04,590 --> 00:17:08,450
Did I say Los Angeles? I meant the team that used to be in Los Angeles..
我說洛杉磯嗎？ 我是說以前在洛杉磯…

222
00:17:08,620 --> 00:17:12,350
and is now in St. Louis. I actually knew that.
現在在聖路易斯隊的球隊 我真的知道這件事

223
00:17:12,530 --> 00:17:15,500
Okay, quick, name three players on that team.
快說出 那只球隊的三個球員

224
00:17:15,660 --> 00:17:17,100
Gretzky..
葛瑞斯基…

225
00:17:18,930 --> 00:17:20,560
Agassi..
阿格西…

226
00:17:22,900 --> 00:17:25,370
I'm a pretty little girl.
我是個小美女

227
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:34,540
Listen to what Sean McMahon wrote in my yearbook senior year.
你們看史恩麥馬洪 在我的紀念冊上寫了什麼

228
00:17:34,750 --> 00:17:39,710
"Dear Rach, you're such a great person." Not girl, "person."
「親愛的瑞秋，你真是個好人」 我不是女孩，我是「人」

229
00:17:39,990 --> 00:17:43,750
I think you're reading a little too much into it.
我想你太敏感了

230
00:17:44,020 --> 00:17:47,890
"You're a great person. Sorry about your teeny weenie."
「你是個好人 關於你有小雞雞的事我很遺憾」

231
00:17:51,670 --> 00:17:53,100
What do you want me to do..
你要我怎麼做？ 你要我…

232
00:17:53,270 --> 00:17:56,500
call everyone in the entire school and tell them it wasn't true?
打電話給全校的人 告訴他們那不是真的？

233
00:17:56,700 --> 00:17:59,230
-Yes. -Also, tell them I'm skinny now.
-對 -順便告訴他們我變瘦了

234
00:17:59,740 --> 00:18:02,330
Oh! Me too!
還有我

235
00:18:02,540 --> 00:18:06,070
I won't call anybody. It was a million years ago.
我不會打電話給任何人 那是很久以前的事了

236
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:11,740
I don't care. You told people that I was half and half!
我不在乎 你們告訴大家我是雙性人

237
00:18:12,020 --> 00:18:15,750
I never did anything to hurt you in high school.
在高中時 我沒有做過任何傷害你的事

238
00:18:16,520 --> 00:18:18,390
That's not totally true.
那不完全是真的

239
00:18:18,630 --> 00:18:19,890
-What? -What?
-什麼？ -什麼？

240
00:18:20,090 --> 00:18:22,890
You did start that rumor about Ross..
你告訴大家羅斯…

241
00:18:23,130 --> 00:18:27,900
making out with Mrs. Altmann, our 50-year-old librarian.
跟50歲大的圖書館員 亞特曼太太親親抱抱

242
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:30,630
How did you know that?
你怎麼知道那個的？

243
00:18:33,770 --> 00:18:37,210
-It's true? -No.
-那是真的？ -不

244
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:41,900
Yes, it is. I saw you guys going at it behind the card catalog.
不，那是真的，我看到你們 躲在書卡櫃的後面

245
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:47,110
-Hey, what were you doing in the library? -They had magazines.
-你在圖書館裡做什麼？ -圖書館裡有雜誌

246
00:18:47,290 --> 00:18:49,810
Mrs. Altmann? She also made out..
亞特曼太太，她在…

247
00:18:50,060 --> 00:18:54,120
with Ta-Taka-Ki-Kek the night before he went back to Thailand.
塔塔卡奇奇回泰國前一晚 也跟他耳鬢廝磨了一下

248
00:18:55,230 --> 00:18:58,930
In high school you made out with a 50-year-old woman?
高中時 你跟50歲的女人耳鬢廝磨？

249
00:18:59,170 --> 00:19:03,300
-Hey, she didn't look 50! -Did she look 16?
-她看起來不像50歲了 -她看起來像16歲嗎？

250
00:19:03,540 --> 00:19:07,670
There's a picture of her in the yearbook actually.
事實上紀念冊裡 有她的照片

251
00:19:08,180 --> 00:19:12,080
-Wow. -She didn't photograph well!
-哇 -她不太上相

252
00:19:12,310 --> 00:19:14,680
She probably wasn't familiar with the process..
或者她不知道 該怎麼…

253
00:19:14,850 --> 00:19:17,940
having spent most of her life sitting for oil paintings.
花時間 練習坐下來當油畫模特兒

254
00:19:19,450 --> 00:19:24,150
How did this happen? Did she lure you to an early-bird dinner?
這是怎麼發生的？ 她一放學就請你吃晚餐引誘你？

255
00:19:30,230 --> 00:19:35,830
I was working late in the library one afternoon. It was just the two of us.
有一天下午我在圖書館裡看書看得很晚 館裡只有我們兩個

256
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:40,000
She needed some help with her word jumble.
她需要人幫忙玩填字遊戲

257
00:19:40,410 --> 00:19:44,170
And one thing led to another.
事情很自然就發生了

258
00:19:44,750 --> 00:19:50,410
If you must know, Anita was very gentle and tender.
我得告訴你們 安妮塔非常仁慈溫柔

259
00:19:53,420 --> 00:19:55,850
May she rest in peace.
希望她能得到安息

260
00:19:57,220 --> 00:20:01,680
-Didn't she walk with a cane? -Only when it was damp!
-她不是柱著柺杖走路嗎？ -只有在天氣潮濕時

261
00:20:02,130 --> 00:20:07,160
I can't believe you told people about this. Everybody knew?
我不相信你告訴大家這件事 大家都知道嗎？

262
00:20:07,430 --> 00:20:11,770
-You know what? I'm back in the club! -Yeah!
-好了，我要重回社團 -耶

263
00:20:11,940 --> 00:20:14,840
-Shall I call the meeting to order? -Is everybody present?
-我要召開大會嗎？ -大家都得來嗎？

264
00:20:15,010 --> 00:20:17,440
With the exception of Ta-Taka.
只有塔塔卡沒有

265
00:20:17,610 --> 00:20:19,480
-I wanna join! -Phoebe?
-我要加入 -菲比

266
00:20:19,710 --> 00:20:24,050
I'm sorry, but I never got to be in a club. I didn't go to high school.
抱歉，我從來沒有加入過社團 我沒有念過高中

267
00:20:24,320 --> 00:20:28,910
But three of us would meet behind a dumpster to learn French.
但我們三個 可以躲在垃圾箱後面學法文

268
00:20:29,160 --> 00:20:32,060
Fine, you can have your stupid, little club.
好吧 你們可以繼續那個愚蠢的小社團

269
00:20:32,230 --> 00:20:36,690
But what you did to me is way worse than what I did to you.
但你對我做的事 比我對你做的事更糟糕

270
00:20:36,900 --> 00:20:40,360
-You gave me a teeny weenie. -Yeah!
-你說我有小雞雞 -對

271
00:20:43,540 --> 00:20:47,530
You're just being silly. Rachel, even with that rumor..
你真的太傻了 瑞秋，即使有那個謠言…

272
00:20:47,710 --> 00:20:52,010
you were one of the most popular girls. Everyone wanted to be like you.
你還是最受歡迎的女孩 大家都希望能跟你一樣

273
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:56,050
One girl wanted to be like you so much, she stuffed her pants with a Tootsie Roll.
有個女孩太想變得跟你一樣 她把棒條糖塞進褲檔裡

274
00:20:56,250 --> 00:20:58,050
Wow.
哇

275
00:20:59,390 --> 00:21:03,580
And Ross, if it weren't for her rumor, no one would've known who you were.
羅斯，要不是她的謠言 沒有人會知道你是誰

276
00:21:03,760 --> 00:21:08,820
-She put you on the map. -As a romancer of the elderly.
-是她讓你成名 -以老女人的情人成名

277
00:21:10,030 --> 00:21:13,230
Mrs. Altmann, you can tell, she used to be pretty.
可以看得出來亞特曼太太 她以前很漂亮

278
00:21:13,430 --> 00:21:17,460
The eyes did still sparkle.
她的眼睛還是會發光

279
00:21:18,270 --> 00:21:22,830
This stuff is so way in the past. You've been through so much since then.
這是很久以前的事了 你們也經歷過很多事

280
00:21:23,110 --> 00:21:26,840
You got so much more important stuff going on in your life.
你們的未來 還有許多更重要的事

281
00:21:27,080 --> 00:21:29,550
Can't you just let this go?
你們不能忘了這件事嗎？

282
00:21:31,990 --> 00:21:35,750
-She's right. -We are having a baby together.
-她說的對 -我們的孩子快出生了

283
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:37,860
Hold on.
等一下

284
00:21:39,160 --> 00:21:41,860
-You got her pregnant? -Yeah.
-你讓她懷孕了？ -對

285
00:21:42,330 --> 00:21:44,660
-Are you getting married? -No.
-你們要結婚了？ -不

286
00:21:44,870 --> 00:21:49,600
So you knocked her up but you're not gonna marry her. Dude.
你搞大她的肚子 但你不娶她，兄弟

287
00:21:52,570 --> 00:21:55,800
-Anybody? -Okay.
-有人要嗎？ -好吧

288
00:22:00,180 --> 00:22:02,840
It's exactly how I imagined it would be.
它跟我想像中完全一樣

289
00:22:05,590 --> 00:22:08,320
All right, where's that turkey?
好吧，火雞在哪裡？

290
00:22:12,990 --> 00:22:18,730
-Those are my maternity pants! -No, these are my Thanksgiving pants!
-那是我的孕婦褲 -不，這是我的感恩節褲

291
00:22:25,170 --> 00:22:28,370
Well, that's it. I'm done.
好了，我吃完了

292
00:22:30,840 --> 00:22:32,870
Here come the meat sweats.
留下了肉汗

293
00:22:37,350 --> 00:22:40,120
Well, Joey, we're all very proud of you.
喬伊 我們非常以你為榮

294
00:22:40,350 --> 00:22:44,290
I believe we can expect a call from the president any moment now.
我相信 總統隨時都會打電話來

295
00:22:45,290 --> 00:22:49,700
-Anything we can do? -No. Just nobody press on my stomach.
-有什麼我們可以幫忙的嗎？ -不必了，但千萬別壓我的胃

296
00:22:49,900 --> 00:22:52,920
You can keep those pants, by the way.
還有，那條褲子你不用還了

297
00:22:54,130 --> 00:22:58,230
What you got there? What is that, pie?
那是什麼？ 那是派嗎？

298
00:22:58,440 --> 00:23:02,600
-Yeah. You want some? -Just cut me a little sliver.
-對，你要吃一點嗎？ -切一小塊給我就行了

299
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:06,910
Little bigger.
大一點

300
00:23:07,950 --> 00:23:09,610
Little bigger.
再大一點

301
00:23:09,880 --> 00:23:12,940
Are you afraid you're gonna run out? Cut me a real piece!
你害怕沒派吃嗎？ 切一大塊給我

302
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


303
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
